    "text": "<p>Given below are two statements:</p><p>Statement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></math>&nbsp;: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></math>-Nitrophenol is steam volatile due to intramolecular hydrogen bonding.</p><p>Statement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>II</mi></math>&nbsp;: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></math>-Nitrophenol has high melting due to hydrogen bonding.</p><p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below:</p>",
